OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners fundraising to fight  
OL,4,Aimmigration plans                      
OL,6,FCampaigners against the proposed       
OL,7,Fexpansion of an immigration removal    
OL,8,Fcentre have launched a fundraiser to   
OL,9,Fcover the legal costs of a public      
OL,10,Finquiry.                               
OL,12,FCampsfield Immigration Removal Centre  
OL,13,Fnear Kidlington reopened in December   
OL,14,Fafter it was shut in 2018 following    
OL,15,Fyears of problems, including riots,    
OL,16,Fescapes and complaints about           
OL,17,Fconditions.                            
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
