OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners fundraising to fight  
OL,4,Aimmigration plans                      
OL,6,FThe Home Office is now proposing to    
OL,7,Fincrease the centre's capacity from 160
OL,8,Fbed spaces to 400, and convert existing
OL,9,Fbuildings, with a public inquiry into  
OL,10,Fthe plans now scheduled for December.  
OL,12,FBut the plans have been met with major 
OL,13,Flocal opposition, with the Coalition to
OL,14,FClose Campsfield spearheading the      
OL,15,Fcampaign against the proposals.        
